                "block_type": "paragraph",
                "text": "A periodic signal has $c_0 = 4$, $c_2 = 2e^{j\\pi/2}$, and $c_3 = e^{j\\pi/6}$. Which set of shifted phases is correct for $x(t-T_0/8)$?",
